&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;High cooperation&lt;/em&gt; mindset for cross-organizational collaboration, balancing competing priorities with &lt;em&gt;integrity&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for advancing &lt;em&gt;safe, beneficial AI systems&lt;/em&gt; through creative technical applications&lt;/li&gt;
