&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineering Lead &amp;amp; Technical Escalation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as primary technical escalation point for the events team during complex productions and technical challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and optimize audio and video systems for event spaces including DSP configuration, microphone placement, and camera configurations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot sophisticated technical issues requiring deep understanding of signal paths, network architecture, and system integration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee and mentor events team members on technical best practices, equipment operation, and troubleshooting methodologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage relationships with AV integrators for system upgrades, installations, and complex technical support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Event Production &amp;amp; Technical Direction&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
