&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a Copyright Operations Program Manager to help build and run Anthropic&#39;s dedicated Copyright Operations program. This role is critical to standing up the infrastructure, workflows, and processes needed to handle copyright compliance at scale. You&#39;ll be responsible for processing DMCA and other copyright takedown notices, managing URL opt-out requests, supporting regulatory compliance workflows, and helping consolidate intake channels into a unified, trackable system. This is a ground-floor opportunity: you&#39;ll be building the program and running it simultaneously, shaping how Anthropic handles copyright operations as our product capabilities and international obligations grow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Legal, Engineering, Safeguards, and Support Ops to develop and iterate on copyright operations workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and report on operational metrics — volume, resolution times, compliance rates — and use that data to identify gaps and improve processes&lt;/li&gt;
