&lt;p&gt;Anthropic is seeking a Corporate Development Integration Lead to own the critical post-signing phase of our M&amp;amp;A activity — from confirmatory diligence through integration planning to full operational follow-through. As Anthropic&#39;s corporate development function matures and transaction volume increases, this role will serve as the connective tissue between deal teams, product and engineering organizations, and the acquired teams themselves, ensuring that acquisitions deliver on their strategic thesis.&lt;/p&gt;
