&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop EMEA startup customer advisory programs that create authentic experiences and deepen relationships with highest-value accounts and influential founders across the region&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
