&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have experience scaling customer marketing programs across multiple European markets&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have fluency in additional European languages (French/German)&lt;/p&gt;
