&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deep knowledge of data center power distribution and cooling architectures, and how they interact with IT load profiles. Experience with reliability engineering, SLA development, and failure-mode analysis.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proficiency in statistical modeling and simulation for infrastructure capacity or power utilization.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Familiarity with SCADA/BMS/EPMS, telemetry pipelines, and control systems. Experience building software that bridges IT and OT.&lt;/p&gt;
