&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Familiarity with SCADA, BMS, EPMS, or industrial control systems and associated protocols (Modbus, BACnet, SNMP)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
