&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Identify design conflicts and drive resolution across mechanical, electrical, and controls disciplines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Maintain and evolve Anthropic’s internal mechanical design standards and reference configurations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;External Partner Coordination&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Serve as the primary mechanical engineering point of contact for external developers, design engineers, and construction partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop scopes of work, equipment specifications, and bid packages for mechanical infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Perform technical due diligence on third-party and colocation facilities, evaluating mechanical designs against program requirements and redundancy targets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Coordinate with equipment vendors and manufacturers on cooling system procurement, including chillers, CDUs, and piping assemblies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Construction &amp;amp; Commissioning&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Monitor mechanical system installation for compliance with design intent and industry standards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Conduct site visits to review progress, resolve field issues, and validate construction quality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Support testing and commissioning of mechanical systems; analyze data and troubleshoot issues.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
