&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong knowledge of chilled-water systems, air-cooled cooling plants, liquid cooling, and redundant piping configurations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience driving and reviewing mechanical design work produced by external engineering consultants.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proficiency in reading and marking up construction drawings, P&amp;amp;IDs, and single-line diagrams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
