&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with B2C2B or PLG motions, and a point of view on how self-serve adoption and enterprise sales programs reinforce one another&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of surfacing opportunities others missed by connecting top-of-funnel behavior to downstream revenue&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building, selling, or marketing developer tools is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
