&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Design Engineer to join our Brand Web team, working at the intersection of design and development to build and maintain Anthropic&#39;s web properties. In this role, you&#39;ll contribute to shipping high-quality web experiences across anthropic.com and claude.com — from interactive marketing pages and data visualizations to internal tooling that keeps our content operations running smoothly. You&#39;ll work closely with designers, engineers, and brand and content teams to translate design intent into polished, production-ready code. Rapid prototyping is a core part of how we work here, and you&#39;ll be expected to move fast.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
