&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;You may be a good fit if you:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have 10+ years of professional experience in government, technology, legal, and/or other policy-relevant environments&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have a track record of effective, information-rich advocacy with Australian government authorities at the federal and/or state level&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have experience analyzing legislation and engaging in regulatory processes&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are energized by agency — you will be the first policy hire in Australia and will be building the operation from scratch&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
