&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Quarterback deals through internal processes — CPQ quote-building, approval routing, contract execution — ensuring accurate, timely completion&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own Anthropic’s deal-making execution processes, ensuring that all commercial workflows can seamlessly navigate internal processes&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build AI-native tooling with internal teams to meaningfully scale our commercial processes&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Optimize operational workflows that reduce friction in the sales cycle and accelerate time-to-close&lt;/p&gt;
