&lt;p&gt;You will have the opportunity to build an ongoing and onboarding process from the ground up. You will ensure our sellers are quickly equipped to provide the best solutions to our customers, operating as thought leaders in the AI space.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead the onboarding classes for our customer-facing teams&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead multiple trainings through various delivery methods including in-person, virtual, and pre-recorded enablement&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own the end-to-end processes of enablement from content production to facilitation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Oversee a Learning Management System, including exam creation, tool administration, and content management&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
