&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner closely with the Head of International Recruiting and EMEA regional/country leads to develop localized talent acquisition strategies that align with business objectives&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Navigate complex European regulatory environments, ensuring full compliance with employment laws across markets including GDPR and country-specific hiring regulations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Serve as a cultural ambassador, bridging US headquarters with EMEA offices and facilitating cross-cultural collaboration across multiple languages and business norms&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
