&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pricing &amp;amp; Commercial Strategy: &lt;/strong&gt;Contribute to pricing and packaging decisions with insurance market insight. Understand value drivers for different insurance segments, competitive positioning, and deal structuring that aligns with how insurers buy technology.&lt;/p&gt;
