&lt;li&gt;JD or CPA required; LL.M. in Taxation or MST a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep technical command of lease characterization and Section 467, bonus depreciation modeling on capital-intensive buildouts.&lt;/li&gt;
