&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Anthropic&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic’s mission is to create reliable, interpretable, and steerable AI systems. We want AI to be safe and beneficial for our users and for society as a whole. Our team is a quickly growing group of committed researchers, engineers, policy experts, and business leaders working together to build beneficial AI systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;Anthropic&#39;s international sales organisation is scaling fast, and we&#39;re building the onboarding to match. As International GTM Onboarding Lead, you&#39;ll join the Productivity team, report to the Head of International Productivity, and be part of shaping what international onboarding looks like at Anthropic from the ground up.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;The global GTM onboarding is the foundation. Your job is to take it further, elevating it for each market, layering in the regional context, market knowledge, and cultural fluency that makes it land locally. Not a rewrite. An elevation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll work closely with the central Productivity team and international sales leadership, understanding what&#39;s working globally and what each market needs. Partnership isn&#39;t part of this role, it &lt;em&gt;is&lt;/em&gt; the role. You&#39;ll build trust quickly and keep everyone aligned as the organisation scales.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;Understand the global onboarding deeply, then elevate it for each market. Own the international onboarding overlay per market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;Design the international onboarding flow: Company → GTM → International → Back in region/role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;Tailor for segment-specific across StartUp, DNB, Mid-Market, and Enterprise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;Work with international sales leadership to understand what each market needs, competitive landscape, buyer dynamics, cultural selling norms&lt;/li&gt;
