&lt;li&gt;Partner with the team on AI adoption efforts — contributing to training materials, documentation, and user guides as new tools ship&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the legal team onboarding process and maintain onboarding content as our tooling evolves&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track adoption signals and surface patterns: what&#39;s being used, what isn&#39;t, and what that tells us about where to focus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You may be a good fit if you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have at least 4–7 years of experience in legal operations, legal technology, or a technical operations role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are comfortable keeping multiple projects organized and visible simultaneously — you can track dependencies, flag risks early, and keep stakeholders informed without being asked&lt;/li&gt;
