&lt;li&gt;Experience working with and selling to large enterprise customers across multiple verticals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to navigate and articulate complex technical, organisational and regulatory requirements of large enterprises, in particular in regulated industries (e.g FSI, Healthcare &amp;amp; Life Sciences)&lt;/li&gt;
