&lt;li&gt;Ability to make ambiguous problems clear and identify core principles that can translate across scenarios&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for making powerful technology safe and societally beneficial&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creative thinking about the risks and benefits of new technologies, beyond past checklists and playbooks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of staying current with emerging AI research and industry trends or similar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
