&lt;p&gt;This role requires someone who is fluent in PE sponsor economics, comfortable navigating multi-stakeholder environments, and capable of managing complex deal cycles from term sheet through operational execution. You’ll work closely with the Head of Private Equity to shape strategy while owning execution across multiple sponsor relationships simultaneously.&lt;/p&gt;
