&lt;p&gt;Own the structuring, negotiation, and execution of PE partnership agreements across multiple engagement models. Draft and iterate on term sheets, revenue commitments, preferred partner status, and engagement economics. Manage deal cycles through internal approvals (Legal, Finance) and external stakeholder sign-off (GP leadership, operating partners, portfolio company CEOs).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sponsor Relationship Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Serve as Anthropic’s primary day-to-day point of contact for multiple PE sponsors. Build deep relationships with operating partners, deal teams, and portfolio company leadership. Run recurring cadences (QBRs, pipeline reviews, executive check-ins) to maintain momentum and surface new deployment opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Portfolio Company Activation &amp;amp; Deployment Oversight&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Drive portfolio company activation by identifying high-value use cases, supporting engagement scoping, and overseeing deployment cycles. Coordinate with FDEs, product, and research to ensure engagements hit quality and timeline gates. Track deployment metrics and communicate progress to sponsor stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Revenue &amp;amp; Pipeline Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own pipeline development and revenue targets for assigned sponsors. Build and maintain a rolling forecast of deployment opportunities across portfolio companies. Drive upsell and expansion within activated accounts.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Coordination&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner with Legal, Finance, Research, Product, and the broader Sales organization to move deals forward and ensure deployment learnings feed back into Anthropic’s product roadmap. Coordinate with SI and implementation partners on engagements that involve joint solution delivery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You May Be a Good Fit If You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have 5–10+ years of experience in financial technology sales, private equity, PE-backed operating roles, management consulting serving PE clients, or technology partnerships with PE sponsors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have strong familiarity with PE fund structures, GP economics, value creation playbooks, and the stakeholder dynamics of sponsor–portfolio company relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a track record of managing multiple concurrent workstreams with competing deadlines and stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are fluent in AI technology and can credibly discuss agentic AI capabilities with both technical teams and PE investment professionals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have an existing familiarity across PE sponsors and can engage credibly at the Operating Partner/Principal level&lt;/li&gt;
