&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Develop and implement sales strategies tailored to digital-native buying cycles and technical evaluation processes to meet and exceed team revenue quotas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Create and maintain accurate forecasts, pipeline management, and reporting while ensuring data integrity in CRM systems&lt;/li&gt;
