&lt;li&gt;Experience leveraging LLMs/AI to augment security operations, build investigative tooling, or automate policy enforcement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with IaC (Terraform), CI/CD pipelines, and DevSecOps practices as they apply to corporate infrastructure management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mobile security for iOS/Android in a BYOD and corporate-managed device environment&lt;/li&gt;
