&lt;p&gt;Possess strong analytical and problem-solving skills with keen attention to detail&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have excellent organizational and project management abilities, with the capacity to manage multiple priorities and deadlines&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Communicate effectively with both technical and non-technical stakeholders&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
