&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Show proven track record of building marketing programs from scratch at a growth-stage company&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have established relationships within social impact conferences (Skoll, SOCAP), education conferences (EDUCAUSE, ASU+GSV), or life sciences/public health communities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Demonstrate experience launching enterprise products with tiered pricing or discount programs (similar to nonprofit SKU launches&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
