&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Show success managing multiple concurrent campaigns across diverse program areas and geographies&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Possess experience with both enterprise sales-assisted motions and product-led growth strategies in mission-driven contexts&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have exposure to life sciences research, public health systems, or workforce development ecosystems&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have experience with AI or machine learning technology marketing&lt;/p&gt;
