&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Languages: Python, TypeScript&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frameworks: FastAPI, React&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Infrastructure: GCP, Kubernetes, Cloud Run&lt;/li&gt;
