&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cloud Storage &amp;amp; Reliability: &lt;/strong&gt;Architect disaster recovery, backup, and replication systems for petabyte-scale data. Ensure high availability and durability of data stored in cloud object storage (GCS, S3). Build systems that protect against data loss and enable rapid recovery.&lt;/p&gt;
