&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Scope and implement new partner processes: Stand up operational processes from 0 to 1 for new partners, including deal registration, reporting, and funding programs&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Gather product feedback and represent the needs of the startup community to inform Anthropic&#39;s product roadmap&lt;/p&gt;
