&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Anthropic&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic’s mission is to create reliable, interpretable, and steerable AI systems. We want AI to be safe and beneficial for our users and for society as a whole. Our team is a quickly growing group of committed researchers, engineers, policy experts, and business leaders working together to build beneficial AI systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a builder-minded Startup Partnerships lead to drive the adoption of Claude within the vibrant French and Southern European startup ecosystem. This is a 0-to-1 opportunity -&amp;nbsp; you’ll be designing and executing innovative programs that enable startups to access and build with Claude across France, and expanding reach into Southern European markets (Spain, Italy, and beyond).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will partner directly with leading French VCs, accelerators, and top startup customers to scale Anthropic’s reach and impact. You’ll define how Anthropic engages with one of Europe’s fastest-growing AI ecosystems and become a trusted AI advisor to founders and the VC community. Paris has emerged as a major European AI hub - home to leading AI labs and a dense concentration of AI-native startups and this role will put you at the centre of it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is for builders — someone founders see as a peer and trusted technical partner, not a traditional partnerships hire. You’ll be hands-on with data, building your own dashboards, and shaping strategy through rigorous analysis.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Net New Logo Acquisition Through Developer Enablement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop and execute Anthropic’s startup GTM strategy for France and Southern Europe, identifying and prioritising top AI-native startups and building tiered engagement programmes that balance personalisation with scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build strategic partnerships with leading French VCs - including Lightspeed, Partech, Elaia, Eurazeo, Serena Capital, Breega, and Singular -&amp;nbsp; that drive portfolio engagement. Design and launch strategic programmes with tier-1 VCs, own relationships end-to-end, negotiate partnership terms, and create exclusive benefits for portfolio companies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Create compelling startup-focused offerings, pricing models, and growth initiatives in partnership with French accelerators and entrepreneurial communities such as Station F, La French Tech, BPI France, and Agoranov.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build and maintain your own analytics infrastructure -&amp;nbsp; design Hex dashboards, write SQL queries, and use data to drive programme optimisation and measure ROI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Drive cross-functional coordination: Lead internal collaboration across Product, Engineering, Finance, Sales, and Corporate Development to ensure alignment on activation and penetration of accounts across the French startup ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ecosystem Events &amp;amp; Community Building&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In partnership with marketing, design and execute targeted events including builder summits, founder salons, hackathons, and demo days in Paris and other key French tech hubs (Paris, Milan, Lyon, Toulouse, Bordeaux).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Champion Anthropic at flagship French and European events such as VivaTech, France Digitale Day, France is AI, and Web Summit to deepen ecosystem visibility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner with French accelerators and incubators including Station F, Wilco, The Family alumni network, and BPI France’s acceleration programmes to identify and engage the next wave of AI builders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build local developer communities around Claude through meetups, technical workshops, and content creation in both French and English.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;VC &amp;amp; Ecosystem Partner Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own executive stakeholder management: Build and maintain stakeholder maps across French VC firms and ecosystem partners; develop executive communication strategies to strengthen senior relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Scope and implement new partner processes: Stand up operational processes from 0 to 1 for new partners, including deal registration, reporting, and funding programmes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Gather product feedback and represent the needs of the French and Southern European startup community to inform Anthropic’s product roadmap.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Programme manage strategic execution: Drive accountability on key action items and milestones to ensure goals with key VCs and ecosystem partners stay on track.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enablement &amp;amp; Content&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Create enablement content, documentation, and trainings to help startups effectively build with Claude — technical content that earns respect from developers and founders, localised for the French market where appropriate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner closely with Sales, Solutions, Product, Events, and other cross-functional teams on integrated activation strategies and account prioritisation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
